  "description": "Most of the proposed works involve internal space reconfiguration, which we understand typically falls outside planning controls. However, one minor external alteration is proposed that we assume does require planning permission:\n\nExternal Works:\nLowering of sills on 2 existing ground-floor classroom windows and creating a wide aperture in that facade, making a new wider opening for bi-folding doors leading to the playground, thereby improving circulation and visibility, providing direct access from that side of the playground into what will be the indoor play space.\n\nInternal Works:\nRemoval of internal partitions to form a single, large indoor play area that extends into the existing external playground, improving flexibility and usage.\n",
